<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Where is The Cherry Orchard playing in London?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Cherry Orchard is playing at Harold Pinter Theatre in London. Your ticket selection will show available performance dates and times, and you can book securely online via Official London Theatre. For the smoothest experience, pick a performance from the calendar and book early for popular dates."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is The Cherry Orchard about?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"When Lyubov Ranevskaya (Kristin Scott Thomas) returns to her childhood estate after years abroad, she finds her family home and beloved cherry orchard under threat."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long is The Cherry Orchard?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The running time for The Cherry Orchard is 2 hours and 30 minutes, including interval. Duration can occasionally vary slightly by performance, but this is the listed length for the production."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What age is The Cherry Orchard suitable for?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Cherry Orchard is recommended for ages 11+ . If you’re bringing younger theatregoers, it’s worth considering themes and attention span alongside the age guidance. Some venues also have their own admission policies, so it can help to double-check requirements before you travel."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"When does The Cherry Orchard open and close?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Cherry Orchard opens on 3rd October 2026 and is currently scheduled to run until 9th January 2027. If you’re planning a trip or booking for a specific week, check the performance calendar for dates and availability, as popular performances can sell faster closer to the run."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"When do tickets for The Cherry Orchard go on sale?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Tickets for The Cherry Orchard go on sale from 16th April 2026. If you’re looking for the widest choice of seats and dates, booking early is usually best - especially for weekends and peak travel periods. Once on sale, you can select a performance and complete your booking online."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where can I buy tickets for The Cherry Orchard?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"You can buy tickets for The Cherry Orchard online through Official London Theatre. Choose your preferred performance in the calendar, select seats if available, and complete your purchase securely."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who is performing in The Cherry Orchard?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Cherry Orchard features a cast including Kristin Scott Thomas (Ranevskaya), Stephen Mangan (Lopakhin), Ruby Bentall (Sharlotta), Megan Cusack (Dunyasha), Karl Johnson (Firs), Anastasia Martin (Anya), Noof Ousellam (Yasha), Jeff Rawle (Pishchik), Jack Riddiford (Trofimov), Vinette Robinson (Varya), Shubham Saraf (Yepikhodov), Peter Wight (Gaev), Kathleen Cranham (Travelling Band & Understudy Anya & Dunyasha), Rachel Dawson (Travelling Band & Understudy Varya & Sharlotta), Fergus Murphy (Travelling Band & Understudy Trofimov), Philip Bosworth (Understudy Lopakhin & Phischik), Alex Childs (Understudy Ranevskaya), Paul Easom (Understudy Gaev & Firs), Miles Paloma (Understudy Yepikhodov & Yasha). Casting can vary by date, so if you’re booking specifically to see a particular performer, it’s worth checking any casting notes for your chosen performance."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What should I wear to see The Cherry Orchard?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"There isn’t a strict dress code for London theatre, so wear whatever you’ll feel comfortable and confident in. Most people go for smart casual - think jeans or trousers with a nice top, a casual dress, or a shirt and trainers. If you’re heading to an evening show, on a date, or celebrating something, you might fancy dressing up a bit more, but it’s completely optional."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What time should I arrive for The Cherry Orchard?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Arriving at least 30 minutes before the scheduled start time helps keep things smooth and stress-free, giving you plenty of time to collect tickets, go through security, and get settled in your seat before the performance begins."}}]}</script>            <script type="module" src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js/vce701823e78c4301a35b7e07294d87301792088814092" integrity="sha512-UKNk8GbxkABxKcXYuLkO16EleLGUkcvJWtpSNmExE0Too3ZaFAxTscNWEc1OdAv5/BikHawapSCaiD2XCmp+Bw==" data-cf-beacon='{"version":"2024.11.0","token":"956b48b02e6b4e1584326326866292ce","r":1,"spa":2}' crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
